1. Mesa (Turnip / freedreno Vulkan driver)
   ----------------------------------------
   The bundled native library `libvulkan_freedreno.so` (located in
   app/src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/) is a compiled build of the Mesa
   freedreno (Turnip) Vulkan driver, Mesa 26.3.0-devel (Vulkan 1.4.354).

   Source: Banners-Turnip v26.3.0-20260801-r5 (A6xx/A7xx standard build)
   Based on Mesa main commit 84f090168c (2026-08-01).

   The DT_SONAME has been patched from "libvulkan_freedreno.so" to
   "vulkan.adreno.so" to match the convention used by the official FCL
   Turnip driver plugins for FCL's linkerhook ICD substitution. Only the
   SONAME string in the ELF .dynstr table was modified (21 bytes in the
   string slot, zero-padded); no code or other data was changed. The
   patch is reproducible via tools/patch_soname.py in this repository.

