2. Banners-Turnip (driver distribution)
   -------------------------------------
   The prebuilt `libvulkan_freedreno.so` was obtained from the
   Banners-Turnip repository (release v26.3.0-20260801-r5), which
   provides automated Mesa Turnip builds for Qualcomm Adreno GPUs.
   The A6xx/A7xx standard build is pure Mesa main with no source patches
   (only three inline NDK r29 compatibility fixes applied at build time).
   The repository notes: "AUTOMATED BUILD — Not guaranteed stable."

   The driver binary therefore remains governed by the upstream Mesa
   MIT License cited in section 1 above.

     Source : https://github.com/The412Banner/Banners-Turnip
     Release: v26.3.0-20260801-r5 (A6xx/A7xx standard)

